        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH27PD8450, Linear Keyed Entry Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Linear Pocket Door Keyed Entry makes locking a sliding pocket door easy. It is mortised into the door and comes with everything you'll need for installation on a sliding door. It comes with a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull. The Linear Keyed Entry Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is available in a huge array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/linear-pocket-door-passage-set-inox-fh27pd8010\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/linear-pocket-door-privacy-set-inox-fh27pd8440\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Linear Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-23/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\", 2-3/4\", or 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway 5 pin mortise cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH27PD8450-specifications.pdf?v=1704262377\"><b>INOX FH27PD8450 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
